Hi everyone, "Larp Sint" is an OSINT tool that a colleague and I wrote in just 24 hours with the help of AI.
The tool has everything you’d look for in an OSINT tool,
such as stealer logs, IP address lookups, or email lookups.

You launch the tool by running the start file.

For the best experience, use
Visual Studio Code.

Once you've done that, go to `start.html` and debug it.

From there, you can register using a fake email and password to access the site.

We built an admin panel that allows you to disable specific OSINT tools as needed; we also included DDoS protection for search queries—something we added just for fun.

I strongly advise against using this tool to break the law; it is intended for personal testing and for practice or learning. I accept no liability if you use this tool for malicious purposes!